@startuml
title 图3：支付成功与包装提醒时序图

actor "小程序用户" as User
participant "lgg-gateway" as Gateway
participant "lgg-business" as Business
participant "lgg-pay" as Pay
queue "RabbitMQ" as RabbitMQ
participant "lgg-notice" as Notice
participant "管理端 WebSocket" as WebSocket

User -> Gateway : 提交订单/发起支付
Gateway -> Business : 创建订单
Business --> Gateway : 返回订单号
Gateway -> Pay : /pay/mock
Pay -> Business : OpenFeign 更新订单状态
Business --> Pay : 更新成功
Pay -> RabbitMQ : publish pay.success
RabbitMQ -> Notice : consume pay.success.queue
Notice -> WebSocket : 推送包装提醒
WebSocket --> User : 管理端看到新订单提醒

@enduml

